  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than three years from the date of this decision.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, as amended by Section 51 of the Planning and Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications:  ADN165-34MA-100 (Rev P2), ADN165-34MA-101 (Rev P2), ADN165-34MA-102 (Rev P2), ADN165-34MA-103 (Rev P2), ADN165-34MA-200 (Rev P2), ADN165-34MA-201 (Rev P2), NGL468082, PP-13836972v1, SS05 : SS55 : SS25 Received:  08 March 2025.  \r\n\r\nReason: In order to ensure the development is carried out in accordance with the planning permission.  ",
    "Condition : 3 - The subdivided house's replacement roof tiles hereby permitted shall be Passaro Spanish blue grey slate roof tiles only and its repainted window sills and surrounds hereby permitted shall be painted white only.  \r\n\r\nThe subdivided house's replacement rear garden northern shared side boundary fence hereby permitted shall be close boarded timber fencing only and its replacement south western single rear gate hereby permitted shall be a close boarded timber gate only.  \r\n\r\nThe bricks used for the repair of the subdivided house's existing front garden front and side boundary walls hereby permitted shall be matching red bricks only.  \r\n\r\nReasons:  To protect the character and appearance of the subdivided house, site and Conservation Area, in accordance with Local Plan Policies SC7, CC1, CC2 and CC4.  "
  ],
